1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,127
Why have you been following me
since last night?

2
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:03,378
What do you mean, "following?"

3
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:04,254
I was...

4
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:05,880
I'm here for training!

5
00:00:06,798 --> 00:00:08,007
Don't be annoying.

6
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:10,676
Come on.

7
00:00:20,228 --> 00:00:21,896
So you were really
training, huh.

8
00:00:22,731 --> 00:00:24,482
Why do you train alone
at this hour?

9
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:25,566
Because I must win.

10
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:29,112
Same here.

11
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:30,655
Same goes to our team too.

12
00:00:32,531 --> 00:00:33,700
You're acting so spoiled.

13
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:42,500
Damn it.

14
00:00:49,924 --> 00:00:50,924
What are you doing?

15
00:00:52,802 --> 00:00:53,803
Throw it right here.

16
00:00:54,471 --> 00:00:55,972
It would be a lot better

17
00:00:56,723 --> 00:00:57,930
than throwing at the net.

18
00:01:00,268 --> 00:01:01,268
Come on!

19
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,688
It's not on me
if you get hurt.

20
00:01:13,364 --> 00:01:14,364
Nice ball!

21
00:01:16,785 --> 00:01:17,785
Hey!
